WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:18.296
The frog was hopping around the lab.

2
00:00:18.297 --> 00:00:26.369
Tom tried some more magic spells.

3
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:32.363
But nothing worked.

4
00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:38.211
"What about a potion?" Cat asked.

5
00:00:38.212 --> 00:00:42.522
"Good idea, Cat," Tom said.

6
00:00:42.523 --> 00:00:48.693
"I'll try to turn that frog into a dog."

7
00:00:48.694 --> 00:00:59.786
Tom mixed some potions.

8
00:00:59.787 --> 00:01:08.581
But none of them worked either.

9
00:01:08.582 --> 00:01:12.204
The next morning there was still no dog.

10
00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:15.347
Tom sighed.

11
00:01:15.348 --> 00:01:18.287
"I better think of something fast.

12
00:01:18.288 --> 00:01:24.380
The birthday party starts soon."

13
00:01:24.381 --> 00:01:28.205
Tom watched the frog hop around the lab.

14
00:01:28.206 --> 00:01:32.303
It hopped near a stack of books.

15
00:01:32.304 --> 00:01:34.406
"Hey!" Tom said.

16
00:01:34.407 --> 00:01:47.188
"Those are old spell books."

17
00:01:47.189 --> 00:01:54.154
Tom flipped through the spell books.

18
00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:57.269
"Here’s a dog spell!" he said.

19
00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:03.837
"The queen wants a special dog," Cat reminded him.

20
00:02:03.838 --> 00:02:09.231
Tom lifted his wand. Poof!

21
00:02:09.232 --> 00:02:12.915
A dog with wings appeared!

22
00:02:12.916 --> 00:02:15.672
"I did it!" Tom said happily.

23
00:02:15.673 --> 00:02:23.247
"It's a flying dog!"

24
00:02:23.248 --> 00:02:26.137
Cat hid in Tom's pocket.

25
00:02:26.138 --> 00:02:32.356
The dog flew all around the room.

26
00:02:32.357 --> 00:02:37.775
"Wizard!" Dirk banged hard on the door.

27
00:02:37.776 --> 00:02:41.100
"The party is starting."

28
00:02:41.101 --> 00:02:45.741
Tom whistled. "Come on, Dog.

29
00:02:45.742 --> 00:02:49.805
It's time to go."

30
00:02:49.806 --> 00:02:55.276
The dog didn't listen to him.

31
00:02:55.277 --> 00:02:59.023
"Come on, Dog!" Tom said again.

32
00:02:59.024 --> 00:03:03.383
But the dog stayed in the air.

33
00:03:03.384 --> 00:03:09.631
Cat peeked out of Tom's pocket.

34
00:03:09.632 --> 00:03:12.414
"Woof! Woof!"

35
00:03:12.415 --> 00:03:21.674
The dog flew right down at Cat!
